    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p><p>This small piece of jewelry has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can take a Magic action to expend 1 charge and turn the jewelry into a sail-powered personal vehicle, about the size and shape of a household door, with a 10-foot-tall sail rising from one side. The transformation ends after 1 hour or when you speak the item’s command word (no action required), and the Windskiff returns to its jewelry form.</p><p>In vehicle form, a Windskiff is a Medium object with AC 12, 30 Hit Points, and a Speed of 40 feet. It hovers a few inches above whatever surface it is on and can glide, moving 5 feet horizontally for every 1 foot it descends in the air. A Windskiff and its riders take no damage from falling.</p>",
